# --- Personal data (NEVER commit — lives in ~/ResumeRewriter) -----------------
# The app reads/writes ~/ResumeRewriter only. A local `data/` folder may exist as
# an optional private mirror (see `python scripts/backup_data.py sync`); it must
# never be pushed. Making the remote public with these files in git history would
# leak them — use `scripts/make_public_clean.sh` to publish a scrubbed copy.
data/
ResumeRewriter/
profile.json
profile.json.bak
*.bak
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Portable data bundles from scripts/backup_data.py — these contain your whole profile,
# résumé history and Q&A memory. NEVER commit one; carry it yourself (USB / private drive).
resumerewriter-backup*.zip
*-backup-*.zip
skills_verified.yaml

